iguang"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p006","text":"頃之，家居數歳。廣家與故潁陰侯孫屏野居藍田南山中射獵。嘗夜從一騎出，從人田間飲。還至霸陵亭，霸陵尉醉，呵止廣。廣騎曰：「故李將軍。」尉曰：「今將軍尚不得夜行，何乃故也！」止廣宿亭下。居無何，匈奴入殺遼西太守，敗韓將軍，後韓將軍徙右北平。於是天子乃召拜廣爲右北平太守。廣即請霸陵尉與俱，至軍而斬之。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"潁陰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"gqv_vyi_jao","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"孫","kind":"person","person_id":"22r_9ka_d00","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"一騎","kind":"person","person_id":"8tg_glo_yg2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"從人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"霸陵尉","kind":"person","person_id":"b3j_bwz_6eq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0053","start":53,"end":54,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0055","start":55,"end":56,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"騎","kind":"person","person_id":"8tg_glo_yg2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0061","start":61,"end":64,"surface":"李將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0066","start":66,"end":67,"surface":"尉","kind":"person","person_id":"b3j_bwz_6eq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"將軍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0099","start":99,"end":103,"surface":"遼西太守","kind":"person","person_id":"cl9_dgs_geu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0105","start":105,"end":108,"surface":"韓將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"ae7_3p9_gx5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0110","start":110,"end":113,"surface":"韓將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"ae7_3p9_gx5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"5k5_3ag_agc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0125","start":125,"end":126,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0133","start":133,"end":134,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0136","start":136,"end":139,"surface":"霸陵尉","kind":"person","person_id":"b3j_bwz_6eq","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","book_id":"b-shiji-109","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p010","text":"居頃之，石建卒，於是上召廣代建爲郎中令。元朔六年，廣復爲後將軍，從大將軍軍出定襄，擊匈奴。諸將多中首虜率以功爲侯者，而廣軍無功。後二歳，廣以郎中令將四千騎出右北平，博望侯張騫將萬騎與廣俱，異道。行可數百里，匈奴左賢王將四萬騎圍廣，廣軍士皆恐，廣乃使其子敢往馳之。敢獨與數十騎馳，直貫胡騎，出其左右而還，告廣曰：「胡虜易與耳。」軍士乃安。廣爲圜陳外向，胡急擊之，矢下如雨。漢兵死者過半，漢矢且盡。廣乃令士持滿毋發，而廣身自以大黃射其裨將，殺數人，胡虜益解。會日暮，吏士皆無人色，而廣意氣自如，益治軍。軍中自是服其勇也。明日，復力戰，而博望侯軍亦至，匈奴軍乃解去。漢軍罷，弗能追。是時廣軍幾沒，罷歸。漢法，博望侯留遲後期，當死，贖爲庶人。廣軍功自如，無賞。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"石建","kind":"person","person_id":"gtg_ugc_14i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0010