on","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0126","start":126,"end":127,"surface":"敢","kind":"person","person_id":"wxj_72p_ry3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0131","start":131,"end":132,"surface":"敢","kind":"person","person_id":"wxj_72p_ry3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0152","start":152,"end":153,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0168","start":168,"end":169,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0197","start":197,"end":198,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0207","start":207,"end":208,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0239","start":239,"end":240,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0266","start":266,"end":269,"surface":"博望侯","kind":"person","person_id":"gqj_xdu_8rf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0290","start":290,"end":291,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0301","start":301,"end":304,"surface":"博望侯","kind":"person","person_id":"gqj_xdu_8rf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m010-0317","start":317,"end":318,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","book_id":"b-shiji-109","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p011","text":"初，廣之從弟李蔡與廣俱事孝文帝。景帝時，蔡積功勞至二千石。孝武帝時，至代相。以元朔五年爲輕車將車，從大將軍擊右賢王，有功中率，封爲樂安侯。元狩二年中，代公孫弘爲丞相。蔡爲人在下中，名聲出廣下甚遠，然廣不得爵邑，官不過九卿，而蔡爲列侯，位至三公。諸廣之軍吏及士卒或取封侯。廣嘗與望氣王朔燕語，曰：「自漢擊匈奴而廣未嘗不在其中，而諸部校尉以下，才能不及中人，然以擊胡軍功取侯者數十人，而廣不爲後人，然無尺寸之功以得封邑者，何也？豈吾相不當侯邪？且固命也？」朔曰：「將軍自念，豈嘗有所恨乎？」廣曰：「吾嘗爲隴西守，羌嘗反，吾誘而降，降者八百餘人，吾詐而同日殺之。至今大恨獨此耳。」朔曰：「禍莫大於殺已降，此乃將軍所以不得侯者也。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"李蔡","kind":"person","person_id":"ocv_s0f_djg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"psw_g1p_89x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"xd0_1s0_wag","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"蔡","kind":"person","person_id":"ocv_s0f_djg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"孝武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"5k5_3ag_agc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0050","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"大將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"q8s_3lk_4sq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0054","start":54,"end":57,"surface":"右賢王","kind":"person","person_id":"bcy_vo1_8z7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0076","start":76,"end":79,"surface":"公孫弘","kind":"person","person_id":"st8_x29_boy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"蔡","kind":"person","person_id":"ocv_s0f_djg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0093","start":93,"end":94,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0099","start":99,"end":100,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0112","start":112,"end":113,"surface":"蔡","kind":"person","person_id":"ocv_s0f_djg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0123","start":123,"end":124,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0135","start":135,"end":136,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0140","start":140,"end":142,"surface":"王朔","kind":"person","person_id":"224_en7_aho","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0154","start":154,"end":155,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0191","start":191,"end":192,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0226","start":226,"end":227,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"224_en7_aho","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0243","start":243,"end":244,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m011-0287","start":287,"end":288,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"224_en7_aho","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","book_id":"b-shiji-109","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p012","text":"後二歳，大將軍、驃騎將軍大出擊匈奴，廣數自請行。天子以爲老，弗許；良久乃許之，以爲前將軍。是歳，元狩四年也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m012-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"大將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"uh7_kln_nf7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m012-0008","start":8,"end":12,"surface":"驃騎將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"tcq_aiz_yru","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m012-0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m012-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"5k5_3ag_agc","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","book_id":"b-shiji-109","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p013","text":"廣既從大將軍青擊匈奴，既出塞，青捕虜知單于所居，乃自以精兵走之，而令廣并於右將軍軍，出東道。東道少回遠，而大軍行水草少，其勢不屯行。廣自請曰：「臣部爲前將軍，今大將軍乃徙令臣出東道，且臣結髪而與匈奴戰，今乃一得當單于，臣願居前，先死單于。」大將軍青亦陰受上誡，以爲李廣老，數奇，毋令當單于，恐不得所欲。而是時公孫敖新失侯，爲中將軍從大將軍，大將軍亦欲使敖與俱當單于，故徙前將軍廣。廣時知之，固自辭於大將軍。大將軍不聽，令長史封書與廣之莫府，曰：「急詣部，如書。」廣不謝大將軍而起行，意甚慍怒而就部，引兵與右將軍食其合軍出東道。軍亡導，或失道，後大將軍。大將軍與單于接戰，單于遁走，弗能得而還。南絶幕，遇前將軍、右將軍。廣已見大將軍，還入軍。大將軍使長史持糒醪遺廣，因問廣、食其失道狀，青欲上書報天子軍曲折。廣未對，大將軍使長史急責廣之幕府對簿。廣曰：「諸校尉無罪，乃我自失道。吾今自上簿。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m013-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m013-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"大將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"uh7_kln_nf7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m013-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"青","kind":"person","person_id":"uh7_kln_nf7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m013-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"青","kind":"person","person_id":"uh7_kln_nf7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m013-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"v2f_t9q_ipy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m013-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":